name2	1666	4164167029144171	a long string beyond the inline limit 998	ünïcödé α 1040	blob 998	2001-02-03	13:23:17	2000-01-01 01:23:17	2000-01-01 01:23:17+00	2 months 49 days	00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000004997	happy	[4997, 4998, NULL]	{'a': 4997, 'b': x4997}	[4997, 4998, 4999]	[{'x': 4997, 'y': y4997}, {'x': 4998, 'y': NULL}]	0	4.1641670000	4996999999999999999999	2000000000000000000	1665.6666	4164.167

